  "instructions": "## Purpose\n\nExamine how the react-admin e-commerce demo composes its admin UI: which pages and field components each resource page renders, how values flow to external react-admin and MUI boundaries, and where the same local component is supplied from several origins.\n\n## Regeneration\n\nClone https://github.com/marmelab/react-admin.git, then from its root:\n\n```sh\nyarn install\nyarn workspace ra-core build && yarn workspace ra-ui-materialui build && yarn workspace react-admin build\nnode \"<generator-directory>/run.js\" \\\n  --base \"examples/demo\" \\\n  --root \"ProductList\" \\\n  \"src\"\n```\n\nThe workspace builds produce the package type declarations the analysis needs; without them react-admin resolves through unbuilt symlinks and every boundary is omitted.\n\n## Refinements\n\nNode source links were dropped because the showcase scope does not contain the target repository files. Components loaded through `React.lazy` dynamic imports are not traced."
}
